      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/28/1/134/3",
      "text": [
        ": حدثا أحمد بن إدريس، قال: حدثنا محمد بن أحمد بن يحيى بن عمران الأشعري، عن محمد بن عيسى بن عبيد، عن الحسن بن راشد، قال: سألت أبا الحسن العسكري عليه السلام بالمدينة عن رجل أوصى بماله في سبيل الله. قال: سبيل الله شيعتنا."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.basel-kadem": [
          "3.\tWe were told by my father, may Allah grant him mercy, that he said: We were told by Ahmad bin Idrees, that he said: We were told by Muhammed bin Ahmad bin Yahya bin Imran al-Ash’ari, from Muhammed bin Isa bin Ubayd, from Hasan bin Rashid, that he said: I asked Abu’l-Hasan al-Askari, peace be upon him, in Medina about a man who bequeathed with what he had (that it should be spent) for the Path of Allah. He said: The Path of Allah is our Shi’a."
        ]
      }
